            "node": {
              "kind": "SERVICE_ACCOUNT",
            },
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        "blurb": "An identity nobody has used in ninety days, still able to act on the asset's behalf. The dormancy is a field Wiz reports, not something derived here.",
