      {
        "blurb": "The real path — asset to identity to bucket — with the identity hidden, so the table reads asset beside data. Deliberately NOT the SENSITIVE_DATA stub, which graphEnrich suppresses exactly where this chain exists: walking to the stub would return only the assets whose path could not be traced.",
